                          "text":  "I am the second Voyager, even though I left first. I launched on August 20, 1977, on the slower road.\n\nThe slow road turned out to be the grand one. In the late 1970s the four giant planets were lined up in a way that happens only about once every 175 years. Each planet\u0027s gravity could fling me on to the next. Jupiter in 1979. Saturn in 1981. And then my team asked: can you keep going?",
